      "markdown": "$$\\begin{aligned}&u_{3}=\\frac{0.1}{34.8*\\sqrt{3}}=0.166\\%\\\\ &y=(1/2)(10/100)^{-2}=50\\\\ \\end{aligned}$$\n\n#### 6.1.3 稳压源波动不确定度分量$(u_{i}$ \n\n稳压源稳压精度0.2%，故\n\n$$\\begin{aligned}&U=\\left(1\\pm0.2\\%\\right)U_{ 额 }=\\frac{\\left(1\\pm0.2\\%\\right)U_{ 额 }}{R_{A}+R_{W}+R}\\quad\\\\ &\\Delta=\\pm0.2\\%I_{ 实 }\\quad\\\\ &\\frac{\\Delta}{I_{ 实 }}=\\pm0.2\\%\\\\ \\end{aligned}$$\n\n均匀分布，估计其可靠性10%。\n\n$$\\begin{aligned}&u_{4}=0.2\\%/\\sqrt{3}=0.12\\%\\\\ &v=(1/2)(10/100)^{-2}=50\\\\ \\end{aligned}$$\n\n### 6.2 功率\n\n#### 6.2.1 示值不确定度分量$u_{2}$ \n\n瓦特表0.5级合格，极限误差为±0.5%，均匀分布，估计其可靠性10%。\n\n$$\\begin{aligned}&u_{2}=0.5\\%/\\sqrt{3}=0.29\\%\\\\ &y=(1/2)(10/100)^{-2}=50\\\\ \\end{aligned}$$\n\n###### 6.2.2 读数不确定度分量6.2.2读数不确定度分量$(u_{3}$ \n\n测量中采用600w量程，分120格，估读误差为1/10格，实际测时读数为38格，均匀分布，估计其可靠性10%。\n\n\n\n$$\\begin{aligned}&u_{3}=\\frac{0.1}{38}\\times100\\%=0.26\\%\\\\ &v=(1/2)(10/100)^{-2}=50\\\\ \\end{aligned}$$\n\n#### 6.2.3 稳压源波动引起的不确定度$u_{4}$ \n\n故\n\n$$\\begin{aligned}&P=\\frac{U^{2}}{R},\\quad\\Delta P=\\frac{\\partial P}{\\partial U}\\Delta U=\\frac{2U}{R}\\Delta U\\\\ &\\frac{\\Delta P}{P}=\\frac{2\\Delta U}{U}\\\\ \\end{aligned}$$",
